flowchart TD
S([Request recipe suggestions]) --> G[US-15 authentication and owner gate]
G --> I[Capture owned inventory and latest saved preferences]
I --> N{Inventory empty?}
N -- Yes --> E[400; prompt manual add; no provider call]
N -- No --> P[Send ingredient names, dietary choices and allergens to AI]
P --> F{Provider success within 30 seconds?}
F -- No --> X[US-09 retryable 503; no partial state]
F -- Yes --> V{Every candidate structurally valid?}
V -- No --> M[US-09 malformed 502; reject batch]
V -- Yes --> A{Any declared excluded allergen?}
A -- Yes --> C[422; withhold whole batch; no persistence]
A -- No --> W[Assign internal ids and commit complete recipe batch]
W --> R([200 recipe summaries; inventory unchanged; no history views])
